# The phase-1 acceptance tour (web/build.sh shots): first boot of a fresh data
# directory, demo backend. Coordinates are canvas pixels (800x480).
# Commands: wait MS | tap X Y | hold X Y [MS] | drag X0 Y0 X1 Y1 [MS] | wheel X Y DY | type TEXT | key NAME
#           | shot NAME | quit
wait 5000
shot 01-onboarding
tap 60 283
wait 3000
shot 02-home
# Chats, then a conversation
tap 80 456
wait 1500
shot 03-chats
tap 400 152
wait 1500
shot 04-conversation
# the on-screen keyboard, then the host keyboard types and Enter sends
tap 380 447
wait 1000
shot 05-keyboard
type Hello from the browser!
key enter
wait 8000
shot 06-sent
# back, Contacts, Settings, Device
tap 18 30
wait 1200
tap 240 456
wait 1500
shot 07-contacts
tap 720 456
wait 1500
shot 08-settings
# the mouse wheel scrolls the page under the pointer (and back up for the next tap)
wheel 200 300 120
wheel 200 300 120
wait 600
shot 08b-settings-wheel
wheel 200 300 -600
wait 600
tap 400 66
wait 1500
shot 09-device
key esc
wait 1000
# Home > Apps > Snake (a Lua app baked into the image)
tap 400 456
wait 1200
tap 695 360
wait 1500
shot 10-apps
tap 398 153
wait 2500
drag 300 300 520 300 250
wait 1500
shot 11-snake
quit
